                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83b07892-2e66-4b2d-ae34-97b53599b796",
                                                "sense_id": "ed093179-1e73-303a-adb0-3482766f0d2f",
                                                "text": "It boots thee not to be compassionate:\nAfter our sentence plaining comes too late."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "compassionate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c580bab9-a2fc-3a11-8bf6-c77fd05e7ea1",
                                        "entry_id": "809b2810-bada-3e15-a65d-210e59411d7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To feel compassion (for someone or with regard to something); to regard (someone or something) with compassion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36d1b54d-f20d-45b1-abf4-0f411dab741c",
                                                "sense_id": "c580bab9-a2fc-3a11-8bf6-c77fd05e7ea1",
                                                "text": "[…] seeing them die so wofully in the flames, he compassionated them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca5b3db7-07bd-437d-b544-a7e4975695d4",
                                                "sense_id": "c580bab9-a2fc-3a11-8bf6-c77fd05e7ea1",
                                                "text": "The Justice which Mr. Allworthy had executed on Partridge, at first met with universal Approbation; but no sooner had he felt its Consequences, than his Neighbours began to relent, and to compassionate his Case;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7e7a490-6e76-453b-94f9-e7e32a772009",
                                                "sense_id": "c580bab9-a2fc-3a11-8bf6-c77fd05e7ea1",
                                                "text": "And yet I could not help bitterly compassionating the honest fellow, brought to the gallows, as he was, strictly speaking, by the machinations of that devil incarnate, Mr. Tyrrel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2367eab7-7131-4b6f-9b25-9847fd3b2bc1",
                                                "sense_id": "c580bab9-a2fc-3a11-8bf6-c77fd05e7ea1",
                                                "text": "“[…] if she were a nice, pretty child, one might compassionate her forlornness; but one really cannot care for such a little toad as that.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e671519f-8ca8-4a8b-a84d-a814aa07ea6e",
                                                "sense_id": "c580bab9-a2fc-3a11-8bf6-c77fd05e7ea1",
                                                "text": "Helen laughed at these sentimental remarks, and wondered that Madame herself did not compassionate her lodger, and console him"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c53a855-ef7c-44fd-b24c-022c1b55d703",
                                                "sense_id": "c580bab9-a2fc-3a11-8bf6-c77fd05e7ea1",
                                                "text": "I explained the circumstances of the past two days, which had driven me to the woods, and he deeply compassionated my distress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb5b83af-f134-4f5a-90d9-c1d1c12f7654",
                        "source_entry_id": "ba83b5ec-7c09-3f06-bd3f-09bea92522e1",
                        "source_sense_id": "67d29389-3554-356d-8fbd-5792bc177334",
                        "source_sense_description": "Mitgefühl erregend",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mitgefühl",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mitgefühl",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2bea05d9-b6a4-3077-90f0-58d22b72c4ac",
                                        "entry_id": "3394060b-c4a9-309a-ab4c-b821dce7dfc0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Teilnahme am Leid anderer"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91a68294-f697-4a82-bc35-e976e4af405a",
                                                "sense_id": "2bea05d9-b6a4-3077-90f0-58d22b72c4ac",
                                                "text": "„Wer wirkliches Mitgefühl hat, leistet tätige Hilfe oder versucht, durch besondere Rücksicht oder ein gutes Wort den Schmerz zu lindern.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcbfc498-3ead-4b04-a0ac-f1f83d90b9de",
                                                "sense_id": "2bea05d9-b6a4-3077-90f0-58d22b72c4ac",
                                                "text": "„Wenn wir glauben, uns zu persönlichem Erscheinen entschließen zu können, dann seien wir uns darüber klar, daß unsere Aufgabe nicht so sehr darin liegt, unser Mitgefühl zum Ausdruck zu bringen, als vielmehr im Trost und in der Aufrichtung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19e71f4c-7a0b-4a49-a686-614b2c08d256",
                                                "sense_id": "2bea05d9-b6a4-3077-90f0-58d22b72c4ac",
                                                "text": "„Wer zu Beginn bei seinem Anblick nur Mitgefühl und Rührung verspürt hatte, der war nun von nackter Begehrlichkeit erfüllt, wer zunächst bewundert und begehrt hatte, den trieb es zur Ekstase.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e117949c-d6d9-4b20-a4e8-09023dbe2f2b",
                                                "sense_id": "2bea05d9-b6a4-3077-90f0-58d22b72c4ac",
                                                "text": "„Ihr Verhalten verriet weder Mitleid noch Mitgefühl.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "061bc98a-9462-4e8a-9d5e-9d9b961a1303",
                        "source_entry_id": "ba83b5ec-7c09-3f06-bd3f-09bea92522e1",
                        "source_sense_id": "67d29389-3554-356d-8fbd-5792bc177334",
                        "source_sense_description": "Mitgefühl erregend",
                        "target_lang_word": "erregen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "erregen",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a3ce784-110e-3f59-a2c2-270959331f68",
                                        "entry_id": "6e5afbf2-c822-3e73-af0e-16eed64585db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemanden oder sich in Unruhe oder Ärger versetzen; jemanden aktivieren; jemanden (sexuell) stimulieren"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "reflexive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7666c419-35aa-4c60-b457-4b114798b798",
                                                "sense_id": "5a3ce784-110e-3f59-a2c2-270959331f68",
                                                "text": "Ich errege mich jedes Mal, wenn ich diesen Film sehe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69b97251-3021-4f73-9ee1-e5670120196e",
                                                "sense_id": "5a3ce784-110e-3f59-a2c2-270959331f68",
                                                "text": "Sie erregt mich derart, dass ich nicht zur Ruhe komme."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c73e9afc-ffb8-30e5-85a5-7787ee0b19ef",
                                        "entry_id": "6e5afbf2-c822-3e73-af0e-16eed64585db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "etwas hervorrufen, einen bestimmten (auffälligen) Zustand erzeugen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d70d420-3b3b-465c-af88-89d1f755d61a",
                                                "sense_id": "c73e9afc-ffb8-30e5-85a5-7787ee0b19ef",
                                                "text": "Die Spule, die durch Strom erregt wird, nennt man Erregerspule."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad2fe280-0555-45f3-ac2e-04411b50bcb0",
                                                "sense_id": "c73e9afc-ffb8-30e5-85a5-7787ee0b19ef",
                                                "text": "Sie will doch bloß Aufmerksamkeit erregen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68a2e737-b9f5-46b5-8a0e-ff105e2e0525",
                                                "sense_id": "c73e9afc-ffb8-30e5-85a5-7787ee0b19ef",
                                                "text": "Der Fall hat sehr viel Aufsehen erregt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
